_{T}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\bot_{T}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a fixed contradiction.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_{T}\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_{T}\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is its standard one-free-variable provability\nformula from [[89-df-provability-predicate]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_{T}\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}statement}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(T)\n\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_{T}\\urcorner}),\n\\qquad\n